DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The pplloocckkssttaatt utility traces pthread locks (mutexes and rwlocks) and
     prints statistics about them.  You can use pplloocckkssttaatt to investigate bot‐
     tlenecks in your software.

     The following options are available:

     --vv      Be verbose.

     --AA      Print all statistics.

     --CC      Print commulative statistics (the default).

     --HH      Print a histogram.

     --VV      Print the DTrace script about to be used to stderr.

     --nn _c_o_u_n_t
             Set the aggregation count for the data set.

     --ss _d_e_p_t_h
             Set the ustack (userland stack) caller depth.

     --ee _s_e_c_s
             Does nothing at the moment.

     --xx _o_p_t=_v_a_l
             Specify DTrace options.  See the dtrace(1) man page for more de‐
             tails.

EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
     The pplloocckkssttaatt utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.

